1
00:01:55,736 --> 00:01:57,736


2
00:02:03,032 --> 00:02:06,743
Lord Sapphire, you've been doing nothing but reading letters lately,

3
00:02:06,775 --> 00:02:08,824
but that won't help your studies!

4
00:02:15,010 --> 00:02:17,160
Today, we shall study mathematics.

5
00:02:17,311 --> 00:02:20,274
To begin with, the first person to establish a school of mathematics

6
00:02:20,298 --> 00:02:23,180
was Archimedes, the great Roman...

7
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:25,820
Wrong! That was Pythagoras of Greece!

8
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:30,860
I was merely testing you. It's common knowledge...

9
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:34,608
A letter from Prince Franz has arrived!

10
00:02:36,805 --> 00:02:37,805
Oh, another one?

11
00:02:46,610 --> 00:02:47,880
Eyes, right!

12
00:03:17,490 --> 00:03:19,940
Thanks, you're a good boy.

13
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,280
Now, hurry and take this reply, Gor!

14
00:03:58,423 --> 00:04:00,096
I hope Gor comes back soon.

15
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:05,460
I know, I'll go meet Gor!

16
00:04:05,849 --> 00:04:07,100
Oh, sorry!

17
00:04:10,184 --> 00:04:11,340
What was that about?

18
00:04:11,510 --> 00:04:14,000
Prince Franz has been acting a bit strange lately.

19
00:04:14,179 --> 00:04:16,166
Sitting at his desk every day...

20
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:19,560
Studying? Isn't that wonderful?

21
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,980
As expected of my nephew.

22
00:04:23,119 --> 00:04:23,901
A letter.

23
00:04:23,925 --> 00:04:27,510
Lord Chanel, this looks rather suspicious.

24
00:04:28,380 --> 00:04:30,060
Could it be a letter from a girl?

25
00:04:30,255 --> 00:04:32,460
No, this isn't a bad thing.

26
00:04:32,915 --> 00:04:37,100
It happens to everyone when they're young. It's quite wonderful, really.

27
00:04:37,545 --> 00:04:41,440
Still, who on earth could he be writing this to...?

28
00:05:01,454 --> 00:05:04,463
Is it true that Silverland and Goldland

29
00:05:04,487 --> 00:05:08,100
have been secretly communicating lately?

30
00:05:08,148 --> 00:05:10,870
A small dog has been crossing the border.

31
00:05:12,098 --> 00:05:17,500
They might be planning a joint attack against our kingdom.

32
00:05:18,765 --> 00:05:20,480
There it comes! Look!

33
00:05:25,829 --> 00:05:30,180
Yes, no doubt about it. It's carrying a silver letter in its mouth.

34
00:05:31,740 --> 00:05:35,400
Yes, that is undoubtedly a secret message from Silverland.

35
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,700
Quick, catch that dog!

36
00:05:53,553 --> 00:05:57,138
How wonderful! Hang in there, little doggy! He beat them again!

37
00:06:06,850 --> 00:06:09,080
Who goes there! How dare you trespass on Goldland's territory!

38
00:06:09,575 --> 00:06:10,820
Stop! Get them!

39
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,600
Ngh!

40
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:34,700
*Haff, haff, haff* Alright, you wanna fight?!

41
00:06:34,701 --> 00:06:35,701
Yeah!

42
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:42,700
*Haff, haff* This'll do.

43
00:07:03,930 --> 00:07:11,780
See you in the next video.

44
00:07:13,005 --> 00:07:14,920
No! No!

45
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:20,880
I don't want sweets! I want Franz!

46
00:07:23,555 --> 00:07:24,940
I told you no...

47
00:07:26,030 --> 00:07:28,280
I hate dolls!

48
00:07:28,955 --> 00:07:32,300
It has to be the real Prince Franz! No, no, no!

49
00:07:32,705 --> 00:07:35,880
I don't want a castle, and I don't want the moon!

50
00:07:36,285 --> 00:07:38,500
Franz is the only one I love!

51
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:44,340
Goodness, what a helpless girl.

52
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:48,220
Why don't we just give the iron stylus to Franz?

53
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:50,580
Who are you?!

54
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:58,360
Don't be surprised. We go wherever Lord X commands.

55
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,760
What!?

56
00:08:00,705 --> 00:08:04,640
Orders from the X-Union. Propose marriage to Franz.

57
00:08:05,380 --> 00:08:08,480
Franz loves Sapphire, so he'll never agree.

58
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:15,980
Then, Charcoal, you'll have an excuse to destroy Goldland for insulting your daughter.

59
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:19,640
And if by any chance he says yes, invite him to this castle...

60
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:30,541
...and kill him. Either way, Goldland will be ours.

61
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:41,500
The X-Union's expansion to the west faces one main obstacle: Goldland. To the north, Silverland.

62
00:08:43,389 --> 00:08:49,940
Join the X-Union or suffer the same fate as Gold and Silver. The choice is yours, Charcoal.

63
00:08:49,941 --> 00:08:52,060
Though it's entirely up to you.

64
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:53,920
Hm?

65
00:09:06,155 --> 00:09:09,620
My, my, when on earth did those two fall in love?

66
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:20,700
I'm astonished. To think King Charcoal's only daughter, Princess Teppy, has proposed to Prince Franz... Lord Chanel, what about that letter from before...?

67
00:09:20,750 --> 00:09:24,540
Ah, right! So the person he was writing to was Princess Teppy?

68
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:25,800
Uncle!

69
00:09:26,809 --> 00:09:27,809
Did you call for me?

70
00:09:30,609 --> 00:09:38,460
Franz, I actually have wonderful news for you today. The person you wrote to every day has proposed marriage to you!

71
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:49,080
Is that true, Uncle?! Of course! Why would I object to the person you love?

72
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:52,960
Thank you, Uncle! Let's go, Sagor!

73
00:09:53,449 --> 00:10:00,460
Hahahahaha...

74
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:23,200
Sapphire, I'm sure you're looking at this beautiful moon, too...

75
00:10:31,509 --> 00:10:32,880
What a beautiful moon...

76
00:10:37,019 --> 00:10:40,240
Aren't you lonely, all by yourself?

77
00:11:06,969 --> 00:11:09,540
Prince Franz, I'll be able to see you tomorrow, won't I?

78
00:11:18,459 --> 00:11:20,800
Lord Sacos has arrived!

79
00:11:26,889 --> 00:11:30,340
Hurry it up. The princess should be here by now.

80
00:11:31,699 --> 00:11:36,240
Please wait just a moment. She is dressing up for her big day, after all.

81
00:11:37,870 --> 00:11:41,640
Apologies for keeping you waiting. Franz will be here shortly as well.

82
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:48,420
Franz must be feeling shy. He's loved her for so long, after all.

83
00:11:51,859 --> 00:11:53,260
Presenting Prince Franz!

84
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,200
Sapphire...

85
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,760
Sapphire...

86
00:12:10,255 --> 00:12:12,440
Ah, you're...

87
00:12:14,109 --> 00:12:17,500
It's Teppy. Franz, you remembered me!

88
00:12:17,995 --> 00:12:20,560
I've been thinking of you the whole time, too.

89
00:12:20,820 --> 00:12:22,620
I love you. I love you so much.

90
00:12:22,925 --> 00:12:26,840
More than Papa, more than Mama, more than the castle, more than the moon.

91
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,860
So much more, forever and ever!

92
00:12:30,529 --> 00:12:38,420
Teppy, you're... you're... / Yes, it's alright, Franz. Everyone understands. You don't have to say a word.

93
00:12:39,125 --> 00:12:41,120
Ah, no! That's not it!

94
00:12:46,009 --> 00:12:47,400
That's not it, Teppy. Forgive me.

95
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,160
Franz!

96
00:12:52,799 --> 00:12:55,040
Unforgivable! Our nation has been insulted!

97
00:12:55,539 --> 00:12:59,860
For the honor of our kingdom, I hereby declare war on Goldland!

98
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,200
Papa!

99
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:05,560
This means war!

100
00:13:05,650 --> 00:13:06,650
No!

101
00:13:07,310 --> 00:13:08,480
No! You can't!

102
00:13:18,129 --> 00:13:19,160
Forgive me, Teppy.

103
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,440
Huh? What is it?

104
00:14:15,319 --> 00:14:17,080
Report! Report!

105
00:14:21,479 --> 00:14:24,080
Sire! Gold River has fallen to the enemy!

106
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:32,980
Report! West Gold Castle has fallen to the enemy! Our forces... our forces have been wiped out!

107
00:14:34,539 --> 00:14:38,880
The enemy is moving too fast! Chakourou must have been preparing for this all along!

108
00:14:39,425 --> 00:14:43,820
The marriage proposal was a trap! We fell right into their trap!

109
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:53,660
Father, at this rate, Goldland will be destroyed! Everyone will be killed! We must do something... but surrender is out of the question!

110
00:14:54,509 --> 00:14:58,080
Fight to the end for the honor of Goldland!

111
00:15:09,325 --> 00:15:10,325
Goru, Goru!

112
00:15:13,149 --> 00:15:16,700
Goru, take this letter to Sapphire. And hurry!

113
00:15:39,599 --> 00:15:42,220
A messenger from Prince Franz has arrived!

114
00:15:43,785 --> 00:15:44,785
Gorun!

115
00:15:46,979 --> 00:15:49,960
What? Charcoalland has launched an invasion!

116
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:52,440
Charcoalland...

117
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:53,580
Gorun!

118
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:53,640
Gorun!

119
00:15:54,490 --> 00:15:59,620
I was careless, Sapphire. I even dragged Teppy into this.

120
00:16:00,539 --> 00:16:03,100
In the end, this was all my fault.

121
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:09,580
Sapphire, I must head to the northern fort now. Please don't worry.

122
00:16:10,545 --> 00:16:13,660
If you come, Silverland will be dragged into the war as well.

123
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:26,100
Franz... Poor Franz... I know! Gor! Go on ahead and protect Franz! I'll follow right behind you!

124
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:43,360
What are you doing?

125
00:16:44,540 --> 00:16:47,140
Hurry, take him to the Black Knight's haunted lair!

126
00:16:50,389 --> 00:16:52,740
Now Goldland, too...

127
00:17:28,039 --> 00:17:29,040
[[WHINNY]]

128
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,880
[[WHINNY]]

129
00:17:39,900 --> 00:17:41,640
Aaaaaah!

130
00:17:49,999 --> 00:17:52,580
Prince Franz is in that castle, isn't he?

131
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,400
Wait!

132
00:17:57,359 --> 00:18:00,720
I was looking for him, too. Take me to Franz!

133
00:18:01,379 --> 00:18:05,620
But your country and Goldland are currently at war!

134
00:18:05,969 --> 00:18:07,420
That doesn't matter!

135
00:18:07,869 --> 00:18:11,340
I love Franz. Love is all that matters.

136
00:18:11,604 --> 00:18:13,860
Come on, let's hurry and rescue him!

137
00:18:16,009 --> 00:18:18,420
Alright, got it. We have no time to waste.

138
00:18:39,919 --> 00:18:43,600
You damn vampire bats, I won't go down that easily!

139
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:10,840
Don't look down! Look up! Keep your eyes up and climb!

140
00:19:18,299 --> 00:19:25,300
Only one week left for Goldland. Silverland is next. I'll be counting on Charcoal then as well.

141
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:30,760
Of course. Now, if you'll excuse me.

142
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:35,400
(Laughs)

143
00:19:36,829 --> 00:19:41,660
Well, we'll make him work as hard as possible. Work him to the bone, then toss him aside.

144
00:19:41,804 --> 00:19:44,520
That is the law of the X-Union.

145
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:47,280
(Laughs)

146
00:19:57,009 --> 00:19:59,740
Oh dear... Papa is just being used.

147
00:20:01,459 --> 00:20:06,220
We're going to search for Prince Franz! Peppy, follow me!

148
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:27,840
So cool! Do your best, Princess Knight! Go, Steve!

149
00:20:29,820 --> 00:20:34,120
Aaaaaah!

150
00:20:34,140 --> 00:20:35,140
Whoa!

151
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:39,220
Are you alright?

152
00:20:40,119 --> 00:20:42,880
How wonderful... to be rescued by you...

153
00:20:43,229 --> 00:20:48,460
M-More importantly, I have to find Franz fast...

154
00:20:49,889 --> 00:20:53,260
Franz! Prince Franz, I've come to save you!

155
00:20:54,124 --> 00:20:55,660
Huh? That voice...

156
00:20:59,739 --> 00:21:05,140
You went in?! There are vampire bats inside!

157
00:21:22,719 --> 00:21:25,700
Saved by you again, huh?

158
00:21:30,055 --> 00:21:32,340
Well, wh—

159
00:21:32,689 --> 00:21:34,840
*Sigh*

160
00:21:38,980 --> 00:21:41,420
Ha-ha!

161
00:21:50,980 --> 00:21:55,520
Heh heh heh.

162
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:57,920
You guys!

163
00:22:20,399 --> 00:22:23,340
How wonderful the Ribbon Knight is...

164
00:22:24,735 --> 00:22:27,180
I think I'm falling for him.

165
00:22:43,420 --> 00:22:48,980
Thank you, Ribbon Knight. I'll hurry home and tell Father to stop the war right away.

166
00:22:49,479 --> 00:22:51,080
And one more thing.

167
00:22:51,269 --> 00:22:54,960
Ribbon Knight... I, I...

168
00:22:55,159 --> 00:22:57,980
I've decided to become your bride!

169
00:23:00,569 --> 00:23:02,120
Franz, I'm sorry.

170
00:23:02,519 --> 00:23:05,700
But that's okay. You have Princess Sapphire, after all.

171
00:23:06,479 --> 00:23:10,940
No, I'm the one who's sorry. I... I love Sapphire.

172
00:23:12,020 --> 00:23:13,020
What's wrong?

173
00:23:13,374 --> 00:23:17,780
It's nothing. You'll understand when you're a bit older.

174
00:23:18,469 --> 00:23:21,040
Wait for me until I grow up!

175
00:23:23,449 --> 00:23:26,340
Ribbon Knight! I love you!

176
00:23:26,364 --> 00:23:28,364

